  "label": "Swastika as Nazi Symbol",
  "description": "The swastika is a symbol historically associated with the Nazi Party and the Holocaust. Its use in this context is not merely decorative but carries deep historical and political weight, representing genocide, racism, and extreme violence. Understanding this requires knowledge of 20th-century European history and the atrocities committed under Nazi rule.",
